88|export const SPLIT_HELP = `How to split it:
89|- Split by responsibility into small modules, one concern per file, roughly under 300 lines.
90|- Put shared types in their own file.
91|- Move fixtures and test data to fixtures/ or public/.
92|- For TS/JS create a folder with an index.ts that re-exports the pieces so imports stay stable.
93|- For docs split by heading into docs/<topic>/*.md with a short index.
94|- For tests split per behavior.
95|- Never minify or remove comments to sneak under the limit.
96|- If the file really is generated or third-party, add its pattern to the ignore list in this script and explain why in the commit message.`;
